00:36:31.910 --> 00:36:32.710
That was really fun.
那真的很有意思。

997
00:36:32.710 --> 00:36:35.690
How did that dynamic come together?
那种动态关系是怎么形成的？

998
00:36:35.910 --> 00:36:38.630
